I'm just a teensy bit ahead of you, having had much the same
experience recently.

Silver dragon scale mail makes you pretty invulnerable, but get
prepared for the lower levels.  Do a bit of sacrificing at an altar
(read scrolls of create monster/zap wands of create monster by the
altar), and donate all your spare cash to a priest to get your native
(armorless) AC down a bit.
- You can explore all the way down to medusa right now, but before
going any deeper you should have:

-- Some method of teleport control (ring or intrinsic via eating a
tengu corpse)
-- Some method of levitation (ring/boots)
-- Magic resistance (cloak maybe)
-- AC down to -15 ish.
-- A stash of holy water
-- A unicorn horn
-- A lizard corpse (those cockatrices are nasty)

If you can find Fort Ludios, there's several dragons on that level
whose corpses will give you useful resistances that you should eat.

While doing the quest, maybe use a second "backup" armour set for most
of it because it'll get burnt, corroded etc whilst doing it, then go
get the good stuff for bashing your quest nemesis.  Zap him with wands
of cold.

When you can, genocide: All liches (L), sea monsters like kraken (;),
and if you can, master mind flayers, disenchanters and rust monsters
too (R).

You'll eventually need other stuff after medusa and descending into
gehennom, but the items you need are fairly common (such as wands of
digging, ring of free action, etc), so don't worry about it now.



